[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0010","text":"这次的服装\n是以草莓为主题的，你觉得怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0020","text":"草莓服装啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0030","text":"哼哼——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0040","text":"嗯？\n怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0050","text":"那个，我穿服装的时候，\n每次都会配合主题调整心情的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0060","text":"哦，这倒是让人佩服……\n如果有什么我能帮忙的，尽管说！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0070","text":"所以呢，这次得吃草莓\n来调整心情才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0080","text":"能帮我准备一下吗——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0090","text":"……\n那是为了工作对吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_01_0100","text":"这不是当然的嘛"}]
